This seems to be a problem for some people.  I fixed it in a number of the conversion pack maps by changing this part:
-- REP Attacking (attacker is always #1)
REP = 1;
CIS = 2;
-- These variables do not change
ATT = REP;
DEF = CIS;
to this:
-- REP Attacking (attacker is always #1)
local
REP = 1;
local
CIS = 2;
-- These variables do not change
local
ATT = REP;
local
DEF = CIS;
What 'local' will do is tell the game that this variable can only be changed by this particular lua, not any other lua.

